OL,3,CDid a lifeguard really punch a shark
OL,4,Con a Jersey beach?
OL,6,FWhy are there so many reports of a
OL,7,Fshark terrorising Jersey - and are
OL,8,Fthey true?
OL,10,FSocial media has been flooded with
OL,11,Fpictures and eye-catching headlines,
OL,12,Fwith some even claiming a lifeguard
OL,13,Fpunched the shark.
OL,15,FITV Channel has sifted through some of
OL,16,Fthe online claims to separate the fact
OL,17,Ffrom the fiction.
OL,19,FWhat actually happened?
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G1/9
