OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F357A1786567665
OL,3,CDid a lifeguard really punch a shark
OL,4,Con a Jersey beach?
OL,6,FITV Channel has contacted RNLI, which
OL,7,Fsaid that the "sensationalist stories"
OL,8,Fmay have been blown out of proportion.
OL,10,FThe RNLI stated: "A lifeguard made
OL,11,Fcontact with a large creature while
OL,12,Fpaddling."
OL,14,FSo there is no evidence of the
OL,15,Fdramatic showdown that is circulating
OL,16,Fonline.
OL,18,FWas it actually a shark?
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G5/9
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
